the basic idea is simple:
in acquire let the thread get the lock address or (get address in case of ticket locking ) using a direct reference to the 
memory.

in the release code make it get this address using another layer of reference so 
AtomicReference<AtomicInteger> putAddr.


When you wish to get high priority for your spin lock simply CAS the above reference with another existing address that you 
should mark out before you do the CAS (so mark it with 1 for non ticket locks).


Heres what will happen whoever owns the current lock will load atomicreference .. get address then make release store to this
address. if your CAS happens before his first load you will get the lock immediately or else worst case you ll have to wait
for one more thread to release the lock.



